WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.515
- He was a martial artist,
actor, teacher, and philosopher.

00:00:04.515 --> 00:00:07.267
He is widely considered to be
one of the most influential

00:00:07.267 --> 00:00:09.507
martial artists of all time.

00:00:09.507 --> 00:00:12.155
He is often credited with
helping change the way Asians

00:00:12.155 --> 00:00:14.614
were presented in American films.

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:18.781
He is Bruce Lee and here are
his top 10 rules for success.

00:00:21.299 --> 00:00:23.966
(intense music)

00:01:42.352 --> 00:01:45.037
- You see, actually, I do
not teach, you know, karate

00:01:45.037 --> 00:01:48.111
because I do not believe
in styles anymore.

00:01:48.111 --> 00:01:51.803
I do not believe that
there is such thing as

00:01:51.803 --> 00:01:55.970
Chinese way of fighting or
the Japanese way of fighting

00:01:57.411 --> 00:02:01.578
or whatever way of fighting
because unless human being

00:02:02.464 --> 00:02:04.878
have three arms and four legs,

00:02:04.878 --> 00:02:07.255
we will have a different form of fighting,

00:02:07.255 --> 00:02:10.242
but basically we have only
two hands and two feet.

00:02:10.242 --> 00:02:13.492
So styles tend to not only separate man

00:02:15.989 --> 00:02:18.100
because they have their
own doctrines and then

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.490
the doctrine became the
gospel truth, you know,

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:23.193
that you cannot change.

00:02:23.193 --> 00:02:25.175
But if you do not have style,

00:02:25.175 --> 00:02:29.242
if you just say, well, here
I am, as a human being,

00:02:29.242 --> 00:02:33.874
how can I express myself
totally and completely?

00:02:33.874 --> 00:02:37.785
Now that way you won't
create a style because style

00:02:37.785 --> 00:02:40.232
is a crystallization, you know?

00:02:40.232 --> 00:02:44.661
That way it's a process
of continuing growth.

00:02:44.661 --> 00:02:47.634
When I look around, I
always learn something.

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:52.473
That is, to be always yourself
and to express yourself.

00:02:52.473 --> 00:02:54.547
To have faith to yourself.

00:02:54.547 --> 00:02:58.387
Do not go out and look for
a successful personality

00:02:58.387 --> 00:02:59.981
and duplicate it.

00:02:59.981 --> 00:03:03.765
Now that seems to me that
that is the prevalent thing

00:03:03.765 --> 00:03:05.682
happening in Hong Kong.

00:03:06.684 --> 00:03:10.604
Like they always copy
mannerism, but they never start

00:03:10.604 --> 00:03:14.771
from the very root of his being
and that is how can I be me?

00:03:17.587 --> 00:03:21.754
A good martial artist does
not become tense, but ready.

00:03:23.602 --> 00:03:26.185
Not thinking, yet not dreaming.

00:03:28.652 --> 00:03:30.985
Ready for whatever may come.

00:03:32.026 --> 00:03:35.109
When the opponent expand, I contract.

00:03:36.092 --> 00:03:38.850
When he contracts, I expand.

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:42.433
When there is an
opportunity, I do not hit.

00:03:48.115 --> 00:03:49.948
It hits all by itself.

00:03:51.405 --> 00:03:53.156
Often times people come up and say,

00:03:53.156 --> 00:03:55.804
"Hey Bruce, are you really that good?"

00:03:55.804 --> 00:03:58.408
I said, well, if I tell you I'm good

00:03:58.408 --> 00:04:01.819
probably you will say I'm boasting.

00:04:01.819 --> 00:04:05.574
But if I tell you I'm no
good, you'll know I'm lying.

00:04:05.574 --> 00:04:07.913
I said empty your mind.

00:04:07.913 --> 00:04:10.080
Be formless, be shapeless.

00:04:11.672 --> 00:04:12.589
Like water.

00:04:13.543 --> 00:04:16.243
Now you put water into a cup

00:04:16.243 --> 00:04:17.561
it becomes the cup.

00:04:17.561 --> 00:04:19.746
You put water into a bottle
it becomes the bottle.

00:04:19.746 --> 00:04:23.055
You put it in a teapot
it becomes the teapot.

00:04:23.055 --> 00:04:25.972
Now water can flow or it can crash.

00:04:26.982 --> 00:04:28.565
Be water my friend.

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:32.783
In case you have missed the recent news,

00:04:33.775 --> 00:04:37.467
Jeet Kune Do, of which I am the (mumbles)

00:04:37.467 --> 00:04:39.983
has been elected and accepted into the

00:04:39.983 --> 00:04:43.626
Black Belt Hall of Fame in America.

00:04:43.626 --> 00:04:48.046
This marks the first
time a recently developed

00:04:48.046 --> 00:04:51.546
form of martial art is nationally accepted

00:04:53.341 --> 00:04:56.771
though Jeet Kune Do is not thousands

00:04:56.771 --> 00:04:59.810
or even hundreds of years old.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:01.893
It started in around 1965

00:05:03.842 --> 00:05:08.009
by a dedicated and intensified
man called Bruce Lee

00:05:09.735 --> 00:05:13.585
and my martial art is
something that no serious

00:05:13.585 --> 00:05:15.752
martial artist can ignore.

00:05:17.294 --> 00:05:21.424
I have no fear of opponent in front of me

00:05:21.424 --> 00:05:24.637
but I am very self-sufficient.

00:05:24.637 --> 00:05:26.387
They do not bother me

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:28.358
and that should I fight

00:05:28.358 --> 00:05:30.411
should I do anything

00:05:30.411 --> 00:05:34.155
I have made up my mind
and that's it, baby.

00:05:34.155 --> 00:05:36.047
You better kill me before.

00:05:36.047 --> 00:05:38.464
What was that, an exhibition?

00:05:39.683 --> 00:05:41.850
We need emotional content.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:47.823
Try again.

00:05:56.834 --> 00:05:57.667
That's it.

00:06:00.351 --> 00:06:02.268
How did it feel to you?

00:06:05.715 --> 00:06:06.965
- Let me think.

00:06:08.512 --> 00:06:10.179
- Don't think, feel.

00:06:13.355 --> 00:06:17.272
It is like a finger
pointing a way to the moon.

00:06:19.981 --> 00:06:23.981
Don't concentrate on the
finger or you will miss

00:06:24.997 --> 00:06:26.997
all that heavenly glory.

00:06:28.503 --> 00:06:31.362
- Well, you know, everyone
talks to me about Bruce Lee

00:06:31.362 --> 00:06:33.396
because Bruce Lee and I
were very good friends

00:06:33.396 --> 00:06:36.000
and we trained together
for like three years

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.708
before he left for Hong Kong
to pursue his movie career.

00:06:39.708 --> 00:06:43.380
I didn't hear anything from
Bruce for like two years.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:46.406
Then out of the blue, Bruce calls me.

00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:48.357
He says, "I've done
two movies in Hong Kong

00:06:48.357 --> 00:06:50.809
and they're really successful.

00:06:50.809 --> 00:06:53.125
I want to do a movie
now with a fight scene

00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:56.113
that everyone will remember

00:06:56.113 --> 00:06:58.884
and I want to do the fight
scene in the coliseum in Rome

00:06:58.884 --> 00:07:02.365
and I want you to be my opponent."

00:07:02.365 --> 00:07:04.597
At that time I held the world title

00:07:04.597 --> 00:07:07.792
and kiddingly I say to Bruce,
"Well who wins, Bruce?"

00:07:07.792 --> 00:07:10.822
And he said, "I win, I'm
the star of this movie!"

00:07:10.822 --> 00:07:12.621
And I said, "Oh, I see.

00:07:12.621 --> 00:07:14.192
You want to beat the world champion."

00:07:14.192 --> 00:07:18.359
He says, "No, I don't, I want
to kill the world champion."

00:07:32.786 --> 00:07:34.953
(screams)

00:07:56.085 --> 00:07:57.192
- Thank you guys for watching.

00:07:57.192 --> 00:08:00.553
I made this video because
the B-Thong asked me to.

00:08:00.553 --> 00:08:02.468
So if there's a famous
entrepreneur you want me

00:08:02.468 --> 00:08:04.635
to profile next, leave
it in the comments below

00:08:04.635 --> 00:08:05.986
and I'll see what I can do.

00:08:05.986 --> 00:08:08.990
I'd also love to know
which of Bruce Lee's tips

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:11.941
you find most relevant, most
helpful, most practical.

00:08:11.941 --> 00:08:13.788
Leave a comment below
and I'm curious to see

00:08:13.788 --> 00:08:15.245
how the discussion goes.

00:08:15.245 --> 00:08:16.648
Thank you so much for watching.

00:08:16.648 --> 00:08:20.148
Continue to believe and I'll see you soon.

